  "reference_solution": "[정답] ①\n\n[해설]\n$\\cos \\left( \\pi - \\theta \\right) > 0$에서 $\\cos \\left( \\pi - \\theta \\right) = - \\cos \\theta$이므로\n$\\cos \\theta < 0$\n$\\sin \\theta = - 3 \\cos \\theta$이므로 $\\sin^{2} \\theta + \\cos^{2} \\theta = 1$에서\n$9 \\cos^{2} \\theta + \\cos^{2} \\theta = 1$,    $10 \\cos^{2} \\theta = 1$\n$\\cos^{2} \\theta = \\frac{1}{10}$    $\\therefore$ $\\cos \\theta = - \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10} \\quad \\left( \\because \\quad \\cos \\theta < 0 \\right)$\n$\\therefore$ $\\sin \\theta = - 3 \\times \\left( - \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{10} \\right) = \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{10}$\n",
  "problem_text": "$\\sin \\theta + 3 \\cos \\theta = 0$이고 $\\cos \\left( \\pi - \\theta \\right) > 0$일 때, $\\sin \\theta$의 값은?\n① $\\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{10}$\t② $\\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5}$\t③ $0$\n④ $- \\frac{\\sqrt{10}}{5}$\t⑤ $- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{10}}{10}$\n",
